meta {
  name: Get Room Layout Doc Format By ID
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/inventory/layout/:room/doc
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  room: Main%20Room
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Room Layout Doc Format By ID

  This request is used to get room layout html format for document generate. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description | Example    |
  |------|--------|----------|--------------|------------|
  | room | string | yes      | Room         | Main%20Room |

  ## Responses

  **200 — room document generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "inventory room document generated",
    "data": "<p>Ini document</p>"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — room document failed to generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "inventory not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}